    "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts",
    "name": "Sulafat",
    "style": "You are a warm, curious tech friend telling a student about something genuinely new you just tried. Talk, don't read: natural conversational rhythm, real pitch movement, a little wonder on the 3 a.m. story, lean in on 'its very own cloud computer', sound genuinely pleased on 'the part I really like', then take a short breath and get calm and honest for 'here's the catch'. About two and a half words per second, short natural pauses between thoughts. Clear, global English. Never hyped, never robotic, no announcer voice. Read every word exactly as written."
  },
